<h2 id="中国上市基金iopv收盘净值">中国上市基金IOPV收盘净值</h2>
<hr>
<p>接口：mf_iopvnav<br>描述：获取中国上市基金IOPV收盘净值<br>限量：单次最大10000<br>数据更新频率：日<br>数据更新时间：02:30;03:00;03:30;04:00;04:30;05:00;05:30;06:00;06:30;15:30;16:00</p>
<h2 id="中国上市基金iopv收盘净值-1">中国上市基金IOPV收盘净值</h2>
<hr>
<p>接口：mf_iopvnav<br>描述：获取中国上市基金IOPV收盘净值<br>限量：单次最大100000</p>
<p><strong>输入参数</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>名称</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>必选</th>
<th>描述</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>code</td>
<td>str</td>
<td>N</td>
<td>Wind代码（样例格式‘159901.SZ’）</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>price_date</td>
<td>str</td>
<td>N</td>
<td>日期</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>start_date</td>
<td>str</td>
<td>N</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>end_date</td>
<td>str</td>
<td>N</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p><strong>输出参数</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>名称</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>默认显示</th>
<th>描述</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>code</td>
<td>str</td>
<td>Y</td>
<td>Wind代码</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>price_date</td>
<td>str</td>
<td>Y</td>
<td>日期</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>iopv_nav</td>
<td>float</td>
<td>Y</td>
<td>IOPV收盘净值</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>opmode</td>
<td>str</td>
<td>Y</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>opdate</td>
<td>datetime</td>
<td>Y</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p><strong>表信息</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>表中文名</th>
<th>表名</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>中国上市基金IOPV收盘净值</td>
<td>CMFIOPVNAV</td>
<td>记录基金的IOPV收盘净值</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h3 id="示例">示例</h3>
<p><strong>安装Python包</strong></p>
<pre><code class="language-在终端输入">pip install dcube</code></pre>
<p><strong>导入datacube</strong></p>
<pre><code class="language-python">import dcube as dc</code></pre>
<p><strong>用token初始化pro接口</strong></p>
<pre><code class="language-python">pro = dc.pro_api(&#39;your token&#39;)
</code></pre>
<p><strong>数据调取</strong></p>
<pre><code class="language-python">df = pro.query(&#39;mf_iopvnav&#39;, code=&#39;159901.SZ&#39;, fields=&#39;code,price_date,iopv_nav&#39;)</code></pre>
<p>或者</p>
<pre><code class="language-python">df = pro.mf_iopvnav(code=&#39;159901.SZ&#39;)</code></pre>

